&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW244694391 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisi_msfontservice,arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;###&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisipilcrow_msfontservice,arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW244694391 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Oregon Clinic:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisipilcrow_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW244694391 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisi_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;The Oregon Clinic transforms lives across the Pacific Northwest by delivering world-class health care through an innovative, physician-led ecosystem of care. As the largest private multi-specialty physician practice in Oregon, we provide expert, compassionate care tailored to the needs of each unique patient. With&amp;nbsp;30&amp;nbsp;specialties and over 300 physicians and practitioners, our&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;spans a broad scope of medicine, from Audiology to OBGYN to Urology. Our doctors serve patients with kindness and empathy at more than 500,000 visits each year, across more than&amp;nbsp;40&amp;nbsp;offices conveniently&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;throughout the Portland metro area. Our vision is for patients to have a consistent, efficient, easy experience and know they will receive the highest quality care from compassionate, trusted experts. Call 503-935-8000 or visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW244694391 BCX0" href="http://www.oregonclinic.com/" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family:wordvisi_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;www.oregonclinic.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisi_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16466489 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Portland, OR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:transparent; font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&ndash;&amp;nbsp;November&amp;nbsp;20,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;2025 &mdash; The Oregon Clinic (TOC) is&amp;nbsp;significantly&amp;nbsp;expanding access&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;Ear, Nose and Throat (ENT)/otolaryngology-head and neck&amp;nbsp;services on the&amp;nbsp;west side&amp;nbsp;of Portland&amp;nbsp;through a recent move&amp;nbsp;into a larger, newly-modernized&amp;nbsp;clinic.&amp;nbsp;Located only one mile from their&amp;nbsp;previous&amp;nbsp;offices on the Providence St. Vincent campus, the new&amp;nbsp;clinic&amp;nbsp;boasts&amp;nbsp;double the exam rooms,&amp;nbsp;upgraded technology,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;space&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;new providers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16466489 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;"We&rsquo;re incredibly proud of the&amp;nbsp;practice&amp;nbsp;we&rsquo;ve grown over the&amp;nbsp;past&amp;nbsp;17&amp;nbsp;years,&rdquo; said Dr. Edsel Kim.&amp;nbsp;&ldquo;This expansion will enable us to better&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;and more quickly&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;serve&amp;nbsp;the needs of our patients&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;foreseeable future.&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16466489 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Since opening in 2008, TOC ENT-West has seen increasing referrals while expanding the scope of services, unfortunately leading to longer&amp;nbsp;wait times for appointments. The new&amp;nbsp;Marlow Avenue location&amp;nbsp;doubles the clinic&rsquo;s&amp;nbsp;footprint&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;7,000 sq ft&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;14,000 sq&amp;nbsp;ft,&amp;nbsp;allowing for expanded capacity and improved patient access.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16466489 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;"Our physicians provide exceptional, personalized&amp;nbsp;care,&rdquo; explained Tim&amp;nbsp;Schiffhauer, Director of Operations.&amp;nbsp;&ldquo;This new space will enable us to hire more providers and support staff. Combined with the increased number of exam rooms, this&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;meaningfully&amp;nbsp;reduce wait times for&amp;nbsp;all&amp;nbsp;our patients.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16466489 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;The&amp;nbsp;expansion&amp;nbsp;will support&amp;nbsp;new equipment and&amp;nbsp;dedicated&amp;nbsp;specialty spaces.&amp;nbsp;The clinic will&amp;nbsp;increase the number of audiologists and&amp;nbsp;sound booths, enabling&amp;nbsp;more&amp;nbsp;timely,&amp;nbsp;state-of-the-art&amp;nbsp;care for hearing loss with the latest technology and surgical care.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;A&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;in-office&amp;nbsp;CT&amp;nbsp;machine will&amp;nbsp;improve access&amp;nbsp;to advanced&amp;nbsp;nasal,&amp;nbsp;sinus&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;ear care.&amp;nbsp; The expanded facility will also allow for&amp;nbsp;continued&amp;nbsp;growth of the clinic&rsquo;s allergy services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16466489 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;TOC's ENT West provides the most up-to-date care for all aspects of general otolaryngology (ear, nose &amp;amp; throat) for adults and children. Their&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;spans everything from&amp;nbsp;ear infections, nasal obstruction, and snoring to&amp;nbsp;complex conditions&amp;nbsp;requiring multidisciplinary care and revision surgery. With advanced fellowship training in facial plastic and reconstructive surgery, neuro-otology, skull&amp;nbsp;base&amp;nbsp;and head&amp;nbsp;and neck oncologic surgery, their&amp;nbsp;providers&amp;nbsp;care for the full spectrum of head and neck conditions&amp;nbsp;for patients not only&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Portland, but&amp;nbsp;throughout&amp;nbsp;Oregon and Southwest Washington.&amp;nbsp;The clinic also offers a complete suite&amp;nbsp;of audiologic&amp;nbsp;services, from&amp;nbsp;hearing evaluations&amp;nbsp;to dispensing and&amp;nbsp;ongoing support&amp;nbsp;of hearing aids.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16466489 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Physicians and practitioners treating patients at the&amp;nbsp;Marlow location are: Neila Bell,&amp;nbsp;AuD; Jennifer Brannon,&amp;nbsp;AuD; Jerae Bryant,&amp;nbsp;AuD; Abigayle Callender,&amp;nbsp;AuD; Kayla Eversole, PA-C;&amp;nbsp;Zipei&amp;nbsp;Feng, MD; Bridget Gharst, FNP-C; Joseph&amp;nbsp;Gullerud, PA-C; Edsel Kim, MD; Briana Murar, PA-C;&amp;nbsp;Tambrie&amp;nbsp;Perez,&amp;nbsp;AuD; Erica Scandalios, PA-C; Brian Shaffer, MD; Sonali Sharma, PA-C; Brian Stater, MD; Kathleen Theilacker,&amp;nbsp;AuD; Elizabeth&amp;nbsp;Tippol,&amp;nbsp;AuD; and Frank Warren, MD.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW16466489 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;The&amp;nbsp;Oregon Clinic&rsquo;s new ENT West&amp;nbsp;office is located at 1815 SW Marlow Ave, Suite 100, Portland, OR 97225.&amp;nbsp;The clinic will&amp;nbsp;continue to&amp;nbsp;see patients Monday through Friday, 8:30 am &ndash; 4:00 pm, and the phone number will remain the same: (503) 935-8100.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

