&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The opinions listed on the death certificate are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Cause of death: &amp;nbsp;Multiple blunt force injuries&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Manner of death: &amp;nbsp;Accident&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;How the injury occurred: Passenger in vehicle in collision with another vehicle&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Place of injury: Roadway&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

