&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&ldquo;We are especially proud that Wenaha&nbsp;Group is Nativeâ'owned and committed to creating inclusive opportunities for all subcontractors,&rdquo; Dale&nbsp;Kuykendall, project executive with Wenaha&nbsp;Group, said. &ldquo;This bond fair is a gateway for emerging trade firms and students to access CCC&rsquo;s bond program. Our goal is to build lasting partnerships that reflect the full diversity of our community.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

