&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Wenaha Group is a Native American-owned owner&rsquo;s representative and project management firm specializing in capital construction, planning, and development. The firm partners with public agencies, educational institutions, tribal governments, and private organizations to guide complex projects from concept through completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
