&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SALEM, Ore.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt; &mdash; A 21-year-old Woodburn man was taken into custody early Thursday morning following the service of a search warrant related to an October shooting incident.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
