&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;The elevator modernization project is part of Clatsop County&rsquo;s continued investment in maintaining safe, accessible, and efficient facilities for the public and employees. For updates visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.clatsopcounty.gov"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clatsopcounty.gov&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

