&lt;p&gt;The Clatsop County Sheriff&rsquo;s Office will be hosting the first annual Winter Boater Safety Inspection Station on Saturday, December 27&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. across from Englund Marine in Astoria.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Be among the first to receive your 2026 Oregon Boater Safety Inspection Sticker.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To get your sticker, please bring the following six items:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Current proof of registration for your boat&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Current registration year sticker posted next to you OR numbers&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Boater safety education course card (or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Non-expired, good condition fire extinguisher&lt;/li&gt;
