&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;A Flood Watch is in effect for Benton County today through Thursday,So Dec. 11. County officials are encouraging everyone to take simple steps now to prepare for potential flooding and winter weather.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW122644181 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;As rain increases and water levels rise, Benton County Emergency Management, Public Works and Community Development encourage all community members to follow local authority guidance and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW122644181 BCX8" href="https://member.everbridge.net/453003085613276/login" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;sign up for local emergency alerts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW122644181 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&ldquo;Flooding can happen quickly, including in areas that don&rsquo;t flood often,&rdquo; said Toby Lewis, Benton County floodplain administrator. &ldquo;Small steps like keeping your foundation vents clear, moving valuables off the floor and staying informed can make a big difference in how your home or business weathers a storm.&rdquo;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW122644181 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;County officials also stress the importance of safe travel during heavy rain and high water.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW122644181 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Remember:&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW122644181 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Always avoid driving through floodwater.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Even a few inches of water can sweep a car off the road. Turn around, don&rsquo;t drown.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW122644181 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be ready to activate your flood safety plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;to keep loved ones, animals and belongings safe while flood waters are high. Oregon Emergency Management&rsquo;s&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW122644181 BCX8" href="https://www.oregon.gov/oem/hazardsprep/pages/2-weeks-ready.aspx" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0000CD"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be 2 Weeks Ready&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt; tool kit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt; can help you prepare for this and other emergencies.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW122644181 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talk with your insurance agent right away about flood insurance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Flood insurance is not included in standard homeowners&rsquo; insurance and must be in place 30 days before a flood event.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW122644181 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unsure of your property&rsquo;s flood risk?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Contact the Benton County Community Development Department to find out more.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

