&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos narrow,aptos narrow_embeddedfont,aptos narrow_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;MULTNOMAH COUNTY, Ore. (MCSO) &ndash; The Multnomah County Sheriff&rsquo;s Office (MCSO) is investigating the death of a 39-year-old man killed in a single-vehicle crash on Sauvie Island.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos narrow,aptos narrow_embeddedfont,aptos narrow_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
