&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos narrow,aptos narrow_embeddedfont,aptos narrow_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;The cause of the single-vehicle crash remains under investigation. Toxicology results are pending with the Oregon State Medical Examiner&rsquo;s Office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos narrow,aptos narrow_embeddedfont,aptos narrow_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
