&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos narrow,aptos narrow_embeddedfont,aptos narrow_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Due to the circumstances of the initial investigation, MCSO&rsquo;s Detective Unit responded to conduct a death investigation. A detective assigned to the East County Vehicular Crimes Team (VCT) is leading the investigation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos narrow,aptos narrow_embeddedfont,aptos narrow_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
